null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-25T19:36:22Z","updated_at":"2026-03-23T20:34:06Z","closed_at":"2026-03-23T20:34:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.1\n\n### System information\n\nUbuntu Studio Linux 24.04\n\n### Issue description\n\nI have a Gridmap Meshlibrary. It's import settings are for Static Lightmaps, on all meshes (this is my default, confirmed after reimporting etc). I have windows, where I've set their \"Mesh Cast Shadow\" to \"Off\" \n\n<img width=\"374\" height=\"270\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/00eeb007-805a-4ee8-accd-6b46af4e1f69\" />\n\nThis works correctly, i make a level, and shadows pass through the window as expected.\n\n<img width=\"747\" height=\"209\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7eeb4d3a-086e-45b0-8248-a4be8a188321\" />\n\nStrangely though, when i click on the LightmapGI and bake lightmaps, it ignores that setting, and bakes as if the mesh were opaque.\n\n<img width=\"900\" height=\"278\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0080e772-21f6-4e69-b395-830a8862d308\" />\n\nAnd strangely, light will continue to be ignored passing through these windows until i go back inthe gridmap and re-add one window pane fresh, then suddenly they all refresh and respect mesh not casting shadow again. Likely something related to breaking the lightmap for their mesh or something? I'm unsure\n\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d401e19d-bc41-49db-984a-6fe7573aa4e0)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI've tested the most basic setup like this:\n\n- Create a new scene.\n- Create a pair of Meshinstance3Ds,\n- Unwrap their UV2 for lightbaking\n- Set one object's geometry settings Cast Shadows = off\n- Export as a gridmap meshlibrary\n\nNow make a new test scene:\n- Add a directional light, set it to bake static\n- Add an object to act as a floor to catch shadow.\n- Add a gridmap node with your new library \n- Add the shapes you created, and see how one casts a shadow and one does not.\n- Add a LightmapGI, and bake. Observe how the non-shadow casting object, suddenly casts shadows.\n- In your gridmap, add that non-shadow object again, and see how suddenly the shadows work again.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MinimalScene.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25555670/MinimalScene.zip)\n\ni didn't create a whole project for it, this is just the essentially scene and meshlibrary ready for the test\n\n<img width=\"656\" height=\"445\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/12680d02-3de8-4926-9ed4-1044f52b07ff\" />\n\n<img width=\"739\" height=\"537\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae5e0468-6238-4c69-9c94-9bfed1e22542\" />\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b6484329-9e27-4a59-b621-7efcc11aa220)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116775/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116775/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}